WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.029
A fund holds investments. An exchange-traded fund,

2
00:00:04.029 --> 00:00:06.669
or ETF, holds a collection of assets

3
00:00:06.669 --> 00:00:08.725
and trades on an exchange.

4
00:00:09.125 --> 00:00:13.312
Spread concentration. Holding different investments can reduce

5
00:00:13.312 --> 00:00:15.928
dependence on one company’s result.

6
00:00:16.333 --> 00:00:19.075
Look inside the basket. Two funds may

7
00:00:19.075 --> 00:00:21.942
own many of the same companies. More tickers

8
00:00:21.942 --> 00:00:24.255
do not always mean more variety.

9
00:00:24.667 --> 00:00:27.525
Risk still remains. A broad stock fund

10
00:00:27.525 --> 00:00:30.420
can fall with the market. Funds also have

11
00:00:30.420 --> 00:00:32.747
fees and different strategies.

12
00:00:33.167 --> 00:00:36.744
Compare before choosing. Study a fund’s holdings,

13
00:00:36.744 --> 00:00:40.640
costs, and purpose. Practice comparing stocks and

14
00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:42.220
ETFs in Sprout.

